            faq("Why would a shaded Lake Nona yard need cleaning more often than a sunny one?", "A high water table keeps shaded ground damp longer after a storm, and that extra moisture favors the algae and light mold a power-broom and sanitizing visit are built to clear before they stain the turf."),
